      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting. Another (very sketchy) idea is to add support for \"optional\" DT_NEEDED in the Bionic linker, which basically would treat a missing library like it exists but has no exported symbols. It\u0027d probably be simpler to implement than DF_P1_LAZYLOAD. But (a) if that\u0027d be a nonstandard ELF extension it\u0027s probably not where we want to go, and (b) it wouldn\u0027t help for modules that need to work in S and earlier.\n\n\u003e The visibility of libcompos_client is limited to \"//art/odrefresh:__subpackages__\".\n\nThat\u0027s good. Please keep me in the loop for future CLs adding this dependency in ART.",
